# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build ---
bin/
obj/
*.user
dist/
*.zip

# ------------------------------------------------------- fetched, not ours ---
# Everything below is downloaded by tools/install-*.bat. None of it is our work
# and none of it belongs in this history.
#
# Deliberately narrow under mpv/: mpv.conf, input.conf, scripts/vrmenu.lua and
# shaders-src/ are OURS and tracked. Only the vendored and generated copies are
# ignored.
mpv/mpv.exe
mpv/*.dll
mpv/scripts/mpv360.lua
mpv/scripts/uosc/
mpv/fonts/
mpv/shaders/
mpv/mpv360.LICENSE
third_party/

# ONNX models, ~14 MB, fetched by tools/install-models.bat. Published elsewhere
# under their own licences; see the README for the sources.
models/
*.onnx

# --------------------------------------------------------- runtime state ---
# Written by the player as it runs. It describes the machine that ran it last,
# which during development is always the developer's — and a release carrying
# it once shipped a window size from a 288 dpi display. See AGENTS.md.
bridge.config.json
window-state.json
mode-memory.json
mpv-last-run.log
mpv-last-run-*.log
mpv/watch_later/
recordings/

# ------------------------------------------------------------- generated ---
# assets/icon.svg is the master and assets/icon.ico is needed by the build;
# the rest is output of tools/make-icon and can be regenerated.
assets/icon-1024.png
assets/icon-512.png
assets/icon-sizes.png

# prompt/ is tracked on purpose: HANDOVER_*.md is the development record handed
# forward between sessions. It is long and Chinese and not a project README,
# which is why it is not README.md any more.
